  "title": "Brisbane Psychologists & Online Therapy Australia-wide | Michelle Barratt Psychology",
  "description": "Clinical psychologist support for trauma, anxiety, depression, ADHD and relationships in Toowong, Manly-West and online across Australia.",
  "html": "<!--$--><section class=\"relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-plum text-white\"><img src=\"https://michellebarrattpsychology.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Meaningful-Brisbane-Psychology-hero-sunflower-scaled.webp\" alt=\"Sunflower field in warm afternoon light\" fetchpriority=\"high\" class=\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover object-center\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-plum/95 via-plum/85 to-plum/35\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-plum/70 via-transparent to-transparent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 py-14 md:py-20 lg:py-24\"><div class=\"max-w-2xl\"><p class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/85 mb-4\">Psychologists · Toowong · Manly-West · and Online Australia-Wide</p><h1 class=\"text-white text-[34px] md:text-[46px] lg:text-[52px] font-semibold leading-[1.06]\">Brisbane Psychologists &amp; <em class=\"text-white/95 italic\">Online Therapy</em> Australia-wide</h1><div class=\"h-[3px] w-16 bg-sun my-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"text-lg md:text-xl font-medium text-white mb-3\">Helping You Navigate Life&#x27;s Challenges With Confidence</p><p class=\"text-white/90 max-w-xl\">Clinical psychologist support for trauma, anxiety, depression, ADHD, relationship challenges and other mental health concerns.</p><p class=\"text-white/90 max-w-xl mt-2\">Available in person at our Brisbane locations and online across Australia.</p><div class=\"mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center min-h-12 px-7 rounded whitespace-nowrap text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] transition-colors duration-300 bg-rose text-white hover:bg-[#9d2a59] \" href=\"/practitioners\">Book Online</a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center min-h-12 px-7 rounded whitespace-nowrap text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] transition-colors duration-300 border border-white/70 text-white hover:bg-white/10 \" href=\"/practitioners\">See Practitioners</a></div></div></div><div class=\"relative bg-gradient-to-r from-plum to-rose text-white text-center text-[13px] font-medium tracking-wide py-2.5 px-5\">Online and in-person appointments available · Mon – Fri 9:00 am – 5:00 pm</div></section><section class=\"bg-soft \"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 py-14 md:py-20 \"><div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-center\"><div><div class=\"mb-8 md:mb-10 max-w-3xl  \"><p class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-2.5 text-rose\">Meaningful Brisbane Psychology</p><h2 class=\"text-[30px] md:text-[42px] font-semibold leading-[1.1] \">Helping You Find the Right Support for Your Journey</h2><div class=\"h-[3px] w-14 bg-sun mt-4 \" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"space-y-4 max-w-xl\"><p><strong class=\"text-plum\">You Are Not Alone.</strong> At Michelle Barratt Psychology, we are committed to helping individuals, couples and families access quality psychological care that is compassionate, evidence-based and centred around their individual needs.</p><p>Whether you are seeking support for yourself, your child, your relationship or your family, our practitioners are committed to helping you move forward with confidence.</p><p>Through our Brisbane locations and Online Therapy services, we facilitate access to professional psychological support across a broad range of mental health concerns and life challenges.</p></div></div><img src=\"https://michellebarrattpsychology.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/meaningful-brisbane-psychology-sunflowers-cra.jpg\" alt=\"Sunflowers in a field, symbolising meaningful Brisbane psychology\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full aspect-[4/3] object-cover rounded\"/></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-blush \"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 py-14 md:py-20 \"><div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-center\"><img src=\"https://michellebarrattpsychology.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/bpd-therapy-nMKIafJb.webp\" alt=\"A calm, welcoming therapy room with warm natural light\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full aspect-[4/3] object-cover rounded order-first\"/><div><div class=\"mb-8 md:mb-10 max-w-3xl  \"><p class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-2.5 text-rose\">Finding the right psychologist</p><h2 class=\"text-[30px] md:text-[42px] font-semibold leading-[1.1] \">Experienced, Compassionate Care</h2><div class=\"h-[3px] w-14 bg-sun mt-4 \" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"space-y-4\"><p>Finding the right psychologist can make a meaningful difference to your mental health journey. Our administration team can help connect you with a psychologist whose experience, therapeutic approach and areas of interest align with your individual needs and goals.</p><p>Each psychologist working with Michelle Barratt Psychology brings unique qualifications, experience and areas of expertise, allowing us to support a wide range of mental health concerns and life challenges.</p><p>Our goal is to ensure <em>you never feel alone</em> and to support you in connecting with the right allied health professional when you need them most. Explore our practitioner profiles to learn more about their professional background, areas of interest and appointment availability.</p></div><div class=\"mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center min-h-12 px-7 rounded whitespace-nowrap text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] transition-colors duration-300 bg-plum text-white hover:bg-[#3a1356] \" href=\"/practitioners\">See Our Practitioners</a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center min-h-12 px-7 rounded whitespace-nowrap text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] transition-colors duration-300 bg-rose text-white hover:bg-[#9d2a59] \" href=\"/practitioners\">Book Online</a></div></div></div></div></section><div data-mbp=\"services\"></div><section class=\"bg-soft \"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 py-14 md:py-20 \"><div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr] gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-start\"><div class=\"lg:sticky lg:top-32\"><div class=\"mb-8 md:mb-10 max-w-3xl  \"><p class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-2.5 text-rose\">Understanding psychology</p><h2 class=\"text-[30px] md:text-[42px] font-semibold leading-[1.1] \">Common Questions About Therapy</h2><div class=\"h-[3px] w-14 bg-sun mt-4 \" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">Common Questions About Therapy &amp; Psychological Support</h3><p class=\"text-[16px]\">Psychology can help individuals better understand their thoughts, emotions and behaviours while developing practical skills to navigate life&#x27;s challenges. Whether you are seeking support for anxiety, depression, trauma, relationship difficulties, emotional regulation challenges or personal growth, therapy provides a confidential and supportive environment to explore concerns and work towards meaningful change.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white border border-lilac rounded p-4 sm:p-6\"><div class=\"w-full max-w-none mx-0\" data-orientation=\"vertical\"><div data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"border-b border-plum/15 last:border-b-0\"><h3 data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-state=\"closed\" class=\"flex\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" id=\"radix-_R_34baq_\" class=\"flex flex-1 items-center justify-between font-medium [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 text-left font-heading text-lg md:text-[22px] leading-snug text-plum py-4 min-h-12 hover:no-underline hover:text-rose transition-colors\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\">How Do I Choose the Right Psychologist?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\