hite mb-1.5\">Faith-Informed and Values-Aligned Support</h3><p class=\"text-white/90 text-[15px]\">Compassionate treatment supporting recovery and improved quality of life.</p></div><div class=\"border-t border-white/30 pt-5\"><span class=\"block h-1.5 w-8 bg-sun mb-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold !text-white mb-1.5\">Flexible Access To Care</h3><p class=\"text-white/90 text-[15px]\">Choose from appointments at our Brisbane locations or Online Therapy appointments available across Australia.</p></div><div class=\"border-t border-white/30 pt-5\"><span class=\"block h-1.5 w-8 bg-sun mb-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold !text-white mb-1.5\">Supporting People of All Ages</h3><p class=\"text-white/90 text-[15px]\">Helping young people build resilience and emotional well-being, and supporting adults and couples with mental health, personal growth, improved communication and life transitions.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center min-h-12 px-7 rounded whitespace-nowrap text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] transition-colors duration-300 bg-white text-plum hover:bg-blush \" href=\"/contact\">Contact Us</a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center min-h-12 px-7 rounded whitespace-nowrap text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] transition-colors duration-300 bg-rose text-white hover:bg-[#9d2a59] \" href=\"/practitioners\">Book Online</a></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-soft \"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 py-14 md:py-20 \"><div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-center\"><img src=\"https://base44.app/api/apps/6ae8c35e42a5884720ac133d/files/mp/public/6ae8c35e42a5884720ac133d/4a27751a0_MBP-Online-Therapy-HD.webp\" alt=\"Online therapy session with Michelle Barratt Psychology\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full aspect-[4/3] object-cover rounded\"/><div><div class=\"mb-8 md:mb-10 